    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your fantasy journey with this fantastic jigsaw puzzle gameProfessional 3D modeling and precise movements allow you to immerse yourself in the game, 25, 50, 600, 2000and other difficult game modes, waiting to experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/471dd1abeb11fee61c368d16f4ce0a4f.poster.avif?t=1736922804\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/471dd1abeb11fee61c368d16f4ce0a4f.webm?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/471dd1abeb11fee61c368d16f4ce0a4f.mp4?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c8This edition contains a picture of the Mona Lisa, van gogh Starry Night\uff0cQingming Map, lotus flowers, a pottery figurine from the Tang Dynasty, and a magnolia vase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/8c82732d40da9859b87a832af1997564.poster.avif?t=1736922804\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/8c82732d40da9859b87a832af1997564.webm?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/8c82732d40da9859b87a832af1997564.mp4?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c8Immerse yourself in soothing alpha music, allowing your brain to relax and relieve stress .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/bfbee4f347b0cff59b7d59d99616ca1a.poster.avif?t=1736922804\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/bfbee4f347b0cff59b7d59d99616ca1a.webm?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/bfbee4f347b0cff59b7d59d99616ca1a.mp4?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/49d27da25a2feb87db8226c759b36e19.poster.avif?t=1736922804\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/49d27da25a2feb87db8226c759b36e19.webm?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/49d27da25a2feb87db8226c759b36e19.mp4?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c8We will update DLC periodically, please stay tuned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/ce78f77c485b006f7622f9c41a8c7c82.poster.avif?t=1736922804\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/ce78f77c485b006f7622f9c41a8c7c82.webm?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340290/extras/ce78f77c485b006f7622f9c41a8c7c82.mp4?t=1736922804\" type=\"video/mp4